PASS clean: actual private client fixture
PASS provided-cap: short provided TX refused
PASS provided-rx: short provided RX refused
PASS hidden-bulk: provided bulk uses exact owner storage
PASS owned-provided: free without allocator ownership
PASS leak-bulk: legacy bulk keeps ownership
PASS overwrite-tx: pending TX refuses buffer overwrite
PASS starve-rx: blocked sender cannot starve reply
PASS early-reply: malformed or premature reply aborts once
PASS no-tx-mark: malformed or premature reply aborts once
PASS lost-terminal: abort completes pending TX once
PASS double-terminal: abort completes pending TX once
PASS retain-tx-borrow: abort detaches TX before retirement
PASS blocking-handshake: blocking engine reached
PASS blocking-read: blocking engine reached
